positions.description:
Sole developer: Light-engine device “CCS2” software controlling suite of LEDs via I2C bus, TECs, photodetector, via USB-serial interface, under Debian Linux on BeagleBone;
Light-engine device “SPARC” software controlling stepper motors for filter slide and port attenuator, via serial interface, on BeagleBone; Gimbal/photodetector system for Lidar safety measurement. UV pulsed-source spectroscopy system.

Primary developer for “Integral” light-measurement software: portable C++ photometry library (with radiometry, photometry, and flicker metrics), threaded control interface to spectrometers (including stray light, nonlinear response, and thermal noise correction), Silicon and InGaAs photodetectors, power supplies, T/Cs, TECs, Plasma lamps; middle Python layer (webserver, SQLite); browser-based UI (JavaScript/JQuery); API’s for .NET, Python, C, LabView; unit/integration tests and system debugging.

